---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout title="Billing Medicare" breadcrumb="Billing Medicare">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="label">Clinical Practice Essentials</div>
    <h1>Billing Medicare as an NP</h1>
    <p>Understanding MBS item numbers, billing rights, and how to maximise your practice revenue while staying compliant.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-prose">

    <div class="highlight-box">
      <h4>⚠️ Important Disclaimer</h4>
      <p>Medicare billing rules change regularly. Always verify current item numbers, fees, and eligibility requirements on the <a href="https://www.mbsonline.gov.au" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MBS Online website</a> before billing. Consider consulting a healthcare billing specialist or your professional indemnity insurer when establishing a billing practice.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>NP Medicare Billing Rights</h2>
    <p>Endorsed Nurse Practitioners have direct billing rights under Medicare — you do not need a supervising doctor to bill. This is one of the most significant and under-utilised rights of NP endorsement in Australia.</p>

    <div class="assessment-grid">
      <div class="assessment-card">
        <div class="card-header"><div class="icon-circle">✅</div><h4>What NPs Can Bill</h4></div>
        <ul>
          <li>Consultations — attendances, telephone, telehealth</li>
          <li>Chronic disease management items</li>
          <li>Mental health treatment plan items</li>
          <li>Preventive health assessments</li>
          <li>Pathology and imaging requests (patient rebate)</li>
          <li>Wound management procedures</li>
          <li>Pregnancy support and antenatal items</li>
          <li>Residential aged care items</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="assessment-card">
        <div class="card-header"><div class="icon-circle">❌</div><h4>Key Limitations</h4></div>
        <ul>
          <li>You must be billing as a Nurse Practitioner — not as an RN</li>
          <li>Some items require collaborative arrangement documentation</li>
          <li>Provider number is linked to your practice location</li>
          <li>Some GP-specific items (e.g. 3GP, 721) are not available to NPs</li>
          <li>Mental health items require specific training/credentialing for some</li>
          <li>Bulk billing is optional — you can charge a gap</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>Getting Your Provider Number</h2>
    <p>Before you can bill Medicare, you need a Medicare provider number. This is linked to both your registration and your practice location — you need a separate provider number for each physical location where you practise.</p>

    <ol>
      <li>Confirm your AHPRA NP endorsement is active</li>
      <li>Apply through <strong>HPOS (Health Professional Online Services)</strong> at servicesaustralia.gov.au</li>
      <li>You will need your AHPRA registration number and practice address</li>
      <li>Provider numbers are location-specific — apply for each site</li>
      <li>Processing typically takes 2–4 weeks</li>
      <li>For locum or multiple sites — apply for each separately</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Key NP Consultation Item Numbers</h2>

    <div class="assessment-card" style="margin-bottom:24px">
      <div class="card-header"><div class="icon-circle">🏥</div><h4>Standard Consultation Items (Level B–D equivalent)</h4></div>
      <div style="overflow-x:auto">
        <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.87rem;margin-top:8px">
          <thead>
            <tr style="background:var(--navy);color:white">
              <th style="padding:10px 12px;text-align:left">Item</th>
              <th style="padding:10px 12px;text-align:left">Description</th>
              <th style="padding:10px 12px;text-align:left">Duration</th>
              <th style="padding:10px 12px;text-align:left">Schedule Fee</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">
              <td style="padding:10px 12px;font-weight:600">82200</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 12px">Consultation in rooms — level 1 (brief)</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 12px">&lt;6 min</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 12px">~$19</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);background:#f9f9f9">
              <td style="padding:10px 12px;font-weight:600">82205</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 12px">Consultation in rooms — level 2 (standard)</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 12px">6–19 min</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 12px">~$41</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">
              <td style="padding:10px 12px;font-weight:600">82210</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 12px">Consultation in rooms — level 3 (long)</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 12px">20–39 min</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 12px">~$79</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);background:#f9f9f9">
              <td style="padding:10px 12px;font-weight:600">82215</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 12px">Consultation in rooms — level 4 (prolonged)</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 12px">≥40 min</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 12px">~$115</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:8px">⚠️ Schedule fees and item numbers change. Always verify at mbsonline.gov.au before billing.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="assessment-card" style="margin-bottom:24px">
      <div class="card-header"><div class="icon-circle">💻</div><h4>Telehealth Items</h4></div>
      <p>NPs have access to telehealth MBS items for both video and phone consultations. Telehealth items generally mirror in-rooms items but have specific eligibility requirements including patient location and consent documentation.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Video consultations — patient must be in a non-metropolitan area OR MMM 2–7 location for some items</li>
        <li>Phone consultations — available with fewer geographic restrictions</li>
        <li>Telehealth items require documented patient consent</li>
        <li>Some items require the patient to have seen the NP in person within the past 12 months</li>
        <li>Check telehealth eligibility at <a href="https://www.mbsonline.gov.au" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MBS Online</a> — the rules vary by item</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="assessment-card" style="margin-bottom:24px">
      <div class="card-header"><div class="icon-circle">📋</div><h4>Chronic Disease and Mental Health Items</h4></div>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>GP Management Plan equivalent (Item 93)</strong> — NPs can create and review care plans for patients with chronic conditions</li>
        <li><strong>Team Care Arrangement equivalent (Item 95)</strong> — NPs can coordinate multidisciplinary care</li>
        <li><strong>Mental Health Treatment Plan (Item 90)</strong> — for patients with mental disorders, enables referral to psychological services</li>
        <li><strong>Health Assessment items</strong> — for Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander patients, aged care residents, children, and adults over 45</li>
        <li><strong>Medication Management Review</strong> — NPs can participate in and bill medication reviews in some contexts</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2>Practical Billing Tips</h2>
    <div class="assessment-grid">
      <div class="assessment-card">
        <div class="card-header"><div class="icon-circle">💡</div><h4>Getting Started</h4></div>
        <ul>
          <li>Use practice management software with Medicare integration — Best Practice, MedicalDirector, or Genie are common</li>
          <li>Set up ECLIPSE or HPOS for online claiming — faster and reduces errors</li>
          <li>Keep contemporaneous consultation notes — Medicare audits do occur</li>
          <li>Document consultation duration accurately — this determines the item level</li>
          <li>Register with the PBS Authority line for restricted benefit prescribing</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="assessment-card">
        <div class="card-header"><div class="icon-circle">⚖️</div><h4>Compliance</h4></div>
        <ul>
          <li>Medicare audits can go back 2 years — keep records</li>
          <li>Inappropriate billing is a serious professional and legal matter</li>
          <li>If unsure about an item — check MBS Online or call the MBS helpline: 132 150</li>
          <li>Document your collaborative arrangement — required for some items</li>
          <li>Notify Medicare if your provider number location changes</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>Key Resources</h2>
    <div class="resources-list">
      <a href="https://www.mbsonline.gov.au" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="resource-link">
        <div class="r-icon">📋</div>
        <div class="r-body"><div class="r-title">MBS Online — Medicare Benefits Schedule</div><div class="r-desc">Complete, searchable MBS item number database — always the authoritative source</div></div>
        <div class="r-ext">↗</div>
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.servicesaustralia.gov.au/medicare-provider-number-application" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="resource-link">
        <div class="r-icon">🔑</div>
        <div class="r-body"><div class="r-title">Services Australia — Provider Number Application</div><div class="r-desc">Apply for your Medicare provider number through HPOS</div></div>
        <div class="r-ext">↗</div>
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.acnp.org.au" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="resource-link">
        <div class="r-icon">🤝</div>
        <div class="r-body"><div class="r-title">ACNP — Australian College of Nurse Practitioners</div><div class="r-desc">NP-specific billing guidance, advocacy, and member support resources</div></div>
        <div class="r-ext">↗</div>
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
